+# PORT-OBF: BackendUtil.cpp registers the statically-linked Obfuscation pass
+# plugin (getObfuscationPluginInfo), so nevercEmit carries that reference.
+# A PRIVATE dependency on a static library propagates link-only to every
+# consumer (neverc driver, test executables), resolving the symbol once at
+# the owning library instead of at each link site.
